CeruleanCity_Text_FatMan::
	.string "I’m a huge fan of CERULEAN GYM’s\n"
	.string "MISTY.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Woman2_1::
	.string "My SLOWPOKE and I make an awesome\n"
	.string "combination!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Woman2_2::
	.string "SLOWPOKE, show me your CONFUSION!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Woman2_3::
	.string "SLOWPOKE: Yarah?$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Woman2_4::
	.string "...$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Boy_1::
	.string "KANTO’s POWER PLANT is toward\n"
	.string "the end of ROUTE 9. There was an\l"
	.string "accident of some sort there.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Boy_2::
	.string "You’re collecting every single kind\n"
	.string "of POKéMON?\p"
	.string "That must be quite a challenge, but\n"
	.string "it sounds fun too.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Slowbro_1::
	.string "SLOWBRO took a snooze…$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Slowbro_2::
	.string "SLOWBRO is loafing around…$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Slowbro_3::
	.string "SLOWBRO turned away…$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Slowbro_4::
	.string "SLOWBRO ignored orders…$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Lass_1::
	.string "Okay! SLOWBRO!\n"
	.string "Use SONICBOOM!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Lass_2::
	.string "SLOWBRO, punch!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Lass_3::
	.string "SLOWBRO, WITHDRAW!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Lass_4::
	.string "Come on, SLOWBRO, pay attention!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Lass_5::
	.string "No!\n"
	.string "You blew it again!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Lass_6::
	.string "No! That’s wrong!\n"
	.string "It’s so hard to control POKéMON!\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON’s obedience depends\n"
	.string "on your abilities as a TRAINER.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Man::
	.string "The CAPE in the north is a good\n"
	.string "place for dates.\l"
	.string "Girls like it!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_WorkerM_1::
	.string "There used to be a cave here that\n"
	.string "had horribly powerful POKéMON in it.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_WorkerM_2::
	.string "Ayuh?\p"
	.string "My ITEMFINDER is responding...$"

CeruleanCity_Text_TeachyTvHost_1::
	.string "Grrr... What kind of GYM LEADER\n"
	.string "leaves its GYM to have a date at\l"
	.string "the CAPE in the north?\p"
	.string "It had to be a female GYM LEADER,\n"
	.string "obviously...\p"
	.string "Oh well...\p"
	.string "At least I’ll have this chance to\n"
	.string "crush your happy dreams!\p"
	.string "...$"

CeruleanCity_Text_TeachyTvHostDefeat::
	.string "...All right...\n"
	.string "You won again...$"

CeruleanCity_Text_TeachyTvHostVictory::
	.string "Hahaha...\n"
	.string "I knew you were no match for me...!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_TeachyTvHost_2::
	.string "...\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "You know what?\n"
	.string "I really don’t care about losing to\l"
	.string "you.\p"
	.string "In fact, I’m happy that you won...\p"
	.string "Because you really deserve the next\n"
	.string "battle against me.\p"
	.string "Keep training {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "You will need it...\p"
	.string "HAHAHAhahaha...!!!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Trigger2::
	.string "CALL FROM PROF.ELM\p"
	.string "PROF.ELM: Hello, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "You sound quite excited...\p"
	.string "Wow... You have two BADGES from\n"
	.string "the KANTO REGION, and you are\l"
	.string "already at CERULEAN?\p"
	.string "Congratulations, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "...What?\n"
	.string "You found a strange POKéBALL?\p"
	.string "Hmmm... That sounds like a mystery\n"
	.string "to be solved...\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "This may be hard for you, but\n"
	.string "could you come back to the lab?\p"
	.string "I’ve heard the SS.AQUA II has\n"
	.string "arrived at VERMILLION CITY.\p"
	.string "Please, I need to see that strange\n"
	.string "POKéBALL!\p"
	.string "I’ll be waiting!\p"
	.string "Click... ... ...$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Trigger3_1::
	.string "{RIVAL}: Yo! {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "You’re still struggling along back\n"
	.string "here?\p"
	.string "I’m doing great! I caught a bunch\n"
	.string "of strong and smart POKéMON!\p"
	.string "Here, let me see what you caught,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Trigger3_2::
	.string "{RIVAL}: Hey, guess what?\p"
	.string "I went to BILL’s and got him to\n"
	.string "show me his rare POKéMON.\p"
	.string "That added a lot of pages to my\n"
	.string "POKéDEX!\p"
	.string "After all, BILL’s world famous as a\n"
	.string "POKéMANIAC.\p"
	.string "He invented the POKéMON Storage\n"
	.string "System on PC, too.\p"
	.string "Since you’re using his system,\n"
	.string "you should go thank him.\p"
	.string "Well, I better get rolling!\n"
	.string "Smell ya later!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Trigger3_3::
	.string "Oh, yeah, right.\p"
	.string "I feel sorry for you. No, really.\n"
	.string "You’re always plodding behind me.\p"
	.string "So here, I’ll give you a little\n"
	.string "present as a favor.$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Trigger3_4::
	.string "A chatty gossip like you…\n"
	.string "That thing’s perfect.\p"
	.string "I don’t need it because I don’t\n"
	.string "give a hoot about others.\p"
	.string "All right, this time I really am\n"
	.string "gone. Smell ya!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Trigger3Defeat::
	.string "Hey!\n"
	.string "Take it easy!\l"
	.string "You won already!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Trigger6::
	.string "The GHOSTBUSTER reveals the GHOST’s\n"
	.string "identity.\p"
	.string "The wild POKéMON attacks!$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Sign1::
	.string "CERULEAN CITY\n"
	.string "A Mysterious Blue Aura Surrounds It$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Sign2::
	.string "CERULEAN CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: MISTY\l"
	.string "The Tomboyish Mermaid$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Sign3::
	.string "There’s a notice here...\p"
	.string "The BIKE SHOP has moved to\n"
	.string "GOLDENROD CITY in JOHTO...$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Sign4::
	.string "There’s a notice here...\p"
	.string "Stamp out thievery and make the city\n"
	.string "a friendlier, more cheerful place!\p"
	.string "CERULEAN POLICE$"

CeruleanCity_Text_Sign5::
	.string "CERULEAN CAPE Ahead$"
